      ],
      "limits": "Bounded independent square and alternating-bound nesting checks; no external transcendental oracle or Interval backend execution. Machin/branch and alternating-series mathematical premises remain explicit."
    },
    {
      "id": "RFA-CL008",
      "statement": "Private truncated-series and sparse rational-map carriers enforce their declared shape/constant/exponent conditions; exact recurrences support formal inverse/log/exp and Jacobian difference as a one-way non-affinity witness, with explicit truncation and sample ceilings.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "code/rust/core_number_theory/src/power_series.rs",
