      "statement": "Quadratic arithmetic has an actual radicand admission mechanism: a private compile-time proof token for fixed D and bounded squarefree validation for runtime D. Private Surd/runtime coordinates preserve canonical radical structure, exact root criteria and sign comparisons; complex and Galois conjugation are explicitly distinct over real fields.",
