          "lines": [
            166,
            209
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limits": "Canonical masks0..3 and phases0..3 avoid this counterexample. This is missing admission, not a failed law on valid field elements; no Rust panic executed."
    },
    {
      "id": "RFA-F005",
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Subset builder silently assumes generator count equals field degree",
      "statement": "build_line_group documents every subset but iterates 0..field.order. For degree1 and two generators it returns only masks0,1, omitting subsets2,3; fewer generators produce repeated rows. No commutation/independence check establishes a line group.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "code/rust/core_number_theory/src/binary_field.rs",
